Suy ra $\triangle ACD \backsim \triangle KCA$ (g-g).

b) Từ $\triangle ACD \backsim \triangle KCA$ suy ra $\dfrac{AC}{KC} = \dfrac{CD}{CA} \Rightarrow AC^2 = CK \cdot CD$.

c) Thay số ta có $AC^2 = \dfrac{320}{17} \cdot 85 = 1600 \Rightarrow AC = 40$ cm.
